      },
      "skos:definition": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Standard carbon foresty under the ETS. Standard forestry refers to post-1989 forests under the ETS that are expected to be regularly harvested and replanted, such as commercial plantation forests. Other commodities (such as sawlog) are compatible."
      },
